# v1.17: More on the last row of a page. The Rename / Move / Delete row used
# to be left out when it did not fit above the bottom buttons, so More looked
# open and nothing showed. The list now scrolls just far enough to show the
# row and its actions together.
# Run: `scripts/sim.sh --headless tests/emu/v1.17-files-more.script docs/screenshots/v1.17`.
make-notes 30
tap-on Files
shot v1.17-files-page
# n007 is the last row that fits on the page.
tap-on More:n007.md
shot v1.17-files-more-last-row
# The actions are there to tap (the first Delete tap only arms it).
tap-on Delete
shot v1.17-files-more-last-row-armed
# Close it again with the same tap; the list stays where it is.
tap-on More:n007.md
# A row near the top does not move anything.
tap-on More:n003.md
shot v1.17-files-more-upper-row
tap-on Rename
shot v1.17-files-more-rename
